## Dependency manifests

The complete transitive dependency set is defined by the pinned source and
image artifacts, including `oasis-go/go.mod`, `oasis-go/go.sum`,
`requirements-ci.txt`, `pyproject.toml`, component manifests in each pinned
submodule, and the container build files. Before distributing release images,
generate and archive an SBOM/license report for the exact image digests; that
report is release evidence, not a replacement for this project `LICENSE`.

## Starter-guide modality icons

The bundled `assets/starter-guide.js` includes the StickyNote, Languages, Film
and Headphones SVG paths from lucide-react 0.563.0, matching the MAPLES UI.
Source: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/tree/0.563.0
Icon paths are embedded without the React runtime; upstream notices are also
retained inside the bundle. These are third-party UI assets, not synthetic or
public-domain demo media.

